# Souls of the Lost: discarding the permanent card Memnite puts it in the graveyard with the sacrificed Black Lotus, so the Souls is
# 2/3 (CR 110.4a, 604.3). When Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills Bot1's Ornithopter on turn 2 the count grows to 3 (a 3/4), and Bot2's own
# Memnite dying in Bot2's graveyard (Bot2 Bolts it itself) is not counted: only Bot1's graveyard is.

